	(text "-- VDD33USB --\nNormally output of the VDD50_USB regulator (3.3v)\n\nConnected as input from Vdd_MCU to supply 3.3v for USB PHY\nStill needs a two external decoupling caps, 100nF cermaic cap and a 1uf\ntantalum or ceramic cap for noise filtering and decoupling\ntantalum is suggested as there is no ESR restrictions"
